{"isSidechain":true,"agentId":"73ef3d2e-c865-43f","type":"toolResult","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_e94d226796d14f57aa50010ff500e75e|fc_07dc770452ad3266016ace47970c0081a28f3a9172941580a2","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nid: 20261006014845-6698\ntitle: 'Integration receipt: Independently review ADR0011 C15 marked-custodial retained-notification lease accounting, callback lifetime, lifecycle joining, refusal atomicity, and compatibility.'\ntype: observation\nstatus: reviewed\ntags:\n    - subagent-handoff\n    - transcript-receipt\nexpires: 2026-11-05T01:48:45.459058Z\ncreated: 2026-10-06T01:48:45.459058Z\nmodified: 2026-10-08T04:18:25.305221Z\n---\nfreshness: aging (5 days ago — may need recheck)\n\n\n\n\nprovider: pi\nsession: 01a1006f-45e5-720d-b422-2d6ae9e3367b\ndisposition: accepted\n\n## Assignment\n\nIndependently review ADR0011 C15 marked-custodial retained-notification lease accounting, callback lifetime, lifecycle joining, refusal atomicity, and compatibility.\n\n## Adopted\n\n- Marked private custodial notifications publish only through RetainedNotificationLease while ordinary RoundTrip legacy Notifications behavior remains unchanged; server requests remain excluded.\n- Exact pre-reserved custody covers message-slice backing plus copied JSONRPC, Method, and Params backing; equality succeeds, actual-plus-one refuses without lease or legacy publication, and zero notifications create no lease.\n- Copied handles converge on exact-once Release; callback admission is terminally closed and panic-safe; admitted callbacks drain before release; STOP timeout/retry does not revoke caller custody; shared retirement makes separate notification-specific RESTART coverage redundant.\n\n## Result\n\n- Accepted bounded C15 retained-notification allocation class only; full C15, requests, responses, ServerError, unmatched/late responses, remarshal policy, C16/C17, and public/production enablement remain excluded.\n- Selected reviewed synthetic source manifest 2278ca6bb7018bec with aggregate sha256:d96105572a0e2f07da9f9a272dee63b7280ba0e311f529fc8f4120701fda88ad and composed source hash 93ae6be4897ff4d554896f8d2b4de8a1ebced65bb0acf3c665b7661d1a8b59c3.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Parent observed focused 90 normal/45 race, full sessionruntime 490 normal/490 race, 1163 downstream normal, 629 downstream race, isolated boundary and reviewed-pin tests, targeted vet, and git diff check pass.\n\n## Reconstruction\n\n```bash\nnn transcript show 01a1006f-45e5-720d-b422-2d6ae9e3367b\n```\n\nObserver installation reports pre-existing backing creation observationally, while operation callbacks remain refusable before effects.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791903639570},"timestamp":"2026-10-13T15:00:39.570Z","cwd":"/Users/schwa/dev/lsp-trace"}
