t`, including local observations. Acquisition-owner capture provenance, selected privacy/withholding behavior, and offline replay of the exact bound request/response therefore remain open. Do not issue a method receipt or infer `COMPLETE_EMPTY` from these manager-local observations.\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/b4_definition_composed_fail_closed_test.go:61\tmsg, _, frame, retained, e := reader.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/b4_definition_composed_manager_test.go:238\tmsg, _, frame, retained, err := r.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/b4_definition_composed_v2_gate_test.go:203\t_, _, captured, retained, err := reader.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_complete_frame_boundary_test.go:44\tmessage, observed, exact, retained, err := lspwire.NewReader(bytes.NewReader(data), lspwire.DefaultLimits()).ReadWithFrameIfWithin(int64(size))\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_complete_frame_boundary_test.go:70\tmsg, _, frame, retained, err := reader.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_cumulative_fixture_helpers_test.go:118\tmsg, observed, _, _, err := lspwire.NewReader(bytes.NewReader(wire), lspwire.DefaultLimits()).ReadWithFrameIfWithin(163)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_cumulative_fixture_helpers_test.go:196\tmsg, _, frame, retained, err := reader.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_observation_test.go:194\t_, _, frame, retained, err := reader.ReadWithFrameIfWithin(4096)\n  /private/tmp/adr0011-incoming-calls-v1-6yiY4m/internal/adr0011methodresult/c_successor_fixture_v2_test.go:67