2. **Correction lineage is not mechanically representable.** `C15_ENUMERATION_PLAN.md` requires each correction revision to identify its predecessor, but the exact TSV schema has no predecessor field. Add `predecessor_row_id`/`predecessor_revision` (or an exact equivalent), include it in reconciliation validation, and specify genesis/null rules.\n\n### Recomputed state\n\n- HEAD: `162d796f7e33fea2c2bdb98f92e41744bb728c2d`\n- Package `SHA256SUMS`: `7143f09e1943c1008d4fe481a3c7ad9639aa64830c7ed82e81e2e0778eeabb97`\n- `SOURCE_MANIFEST.sha256`: `19fe6db1c3f927da6f520d940312449ade7a937e0385fcfb6f9026450e57e8bb`\n- All seven package checksum entries: verified\n- All source-manifest hashes and lengths: matched\n- Generic amendment and interface v1/v2 blocker hashes: matched\n- Git status: eight package files are untracked; no tracked or staged changes\n- Exact READY LSP session: `sk1:9056e071454cbbd51661782b2964d4a8d5c266675df42622d95c5d5032abf0f9`, generation 1\n\nOther requested boundaries—six components, lease-bearing no-escape acquisition, atomic transfer semantics, terminal convergence, immutable blocked predecessors, exact six-plus-four write set, authority `0`, default-off, `CALLS_ONLY`, and D/R separation—are adequately stated.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_07dc770452ad3266016ace4813e52881a2a5f38a27669df34a\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":7978,"output":783,"cacheRead":172544,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":201,"totalTokens":181305,"cost":{"input":0.031911999999999996,"output":0.01566,"cacheRead":0.06901760000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.11658960000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1791903757676,"responseId":"resp_07dc770452ad3266016ace480e886881a29dc44ee3beb92ca0","rawStopReason":"completed","thinkingLevel":"minimal"},"timestamp":"2026-10-13T15:02:51.821Z","cwd":"/Users/schwa/dev/lsp-trace"}
